{
  "id": "1KI.22",
  "number": "22",
  "bookId": "1KI",
  "reference": "Laitorinik 1 22",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 53,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "22",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1KI 22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "22",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Koboktoi Ahab kobokyin Ramotgilead. Meetab Ahab",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kitebi kenyisiek somok ko mami luget kwenutab Suria ak Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eng’ kenyitab somok, kochorgei Jeosapat laitoriatab Juda konyo oldab laitoriatab Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji laitoriatab Israel otwogikyik, Ongen ole nenyo Ramot-Gilead, kitebye, ama kibendi kerebe eng’ eunekab laitoriatab Suria? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji inendet Jeosapat, Ichame kebe tuwai kebarge ak Ramot-Gilead? Ak kilenji Jeosapat laitoriatab Israel, A u kit ne i u, ak u bikyuk biguk, ak u mbartanyisiekyuk mbartanyisieguk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji Jeosapat laitoriatab Israel, Asomin ale teeb eng’ ng’olyotab Jehovah rani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koyum anyun laitoriatab Israel maotik, olo bo bik bogol ang’wan, ak kolenji ichek, Awe kebarge ak Ramot-Gilead, anan atebi? Ak kilenji, Togoste; amu indoi Kiptaiyat eutab laitoriat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago kile Jeosapat, Tos mami maotiotab Jehovah age yu si keteepse inendet? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji laitoriatab Israel Jeosapat, Ta komi chito agenge ne kimuchi keteepse eng’ Jehovah, Mikaia weritab Imla: ago aweche inendet; amu mamaoteni tuguk che miachen agobo ane, kobate yaitiet. Ak kile Jeosapat, Amat komwa laitoriat ko u no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiguur anyun laitoriatab Israel kiptaiyat age ak kolenji, Ui imutu Mikaia weritab Imla ichogune. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiga tebe laitoriatab Israel ak Jeosapat laitoriatab Juda chi tugul ng’echerennyi ne bo laitornatet, kolaachi ngoroikwak che bo laitornatet, eng’ ole bara eng’ ole kibunei eng’ ormarichetab Samaria: ak kimaoteni maotik tugul eng’ tainywa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiyachigei Sedekia weritab Kenaana kuinoikab karik, ak kole, Kamwa Jehovah ko u ni, kole, Itoortoe chuto Suriek, kot kogesgei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kimaotenso maotik tugul ko u noto agichek, kole, Togoste Ramot-Gilead, ak ibor: amu indoi Jehovah ngnasanato eutab laitoriat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak king’alalji inendet chito ne kiga kiyokto koguur Mikaia, kolenji, Keero, kamwachi ng’alek che miach laitoriat ng’alekab maotik eng’ kutit agenge: asomin ale, ingoigei ng’olyondeng’ung’ ng’olyotab age eng’ ichek, ak ing’alal ng’alek che miach. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kile Mikaia, ko u ye sobei Jehovah, ko kit ne mwawa Jehovah, amwae noto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingoit inendet ole mi laitoriat, kolenji laitoriat inendet, Mikaia, kibe Ramot- Gilead kebarge, anan kitebi? Ak kiwolji inendet kolenji, Togoste, ak ibor; ak indoi Jehovah nganasanato eutab laitoriat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji laitoriat, Ayosieun konyil ata ale, amat imwawa kiy age kobate imanit eng’ kainetab Jehovah? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kile, Kiageer Israel tugul ko kaiyesta eng’ tulonok ko u kechirek che matinyei mestowot: ak kimwa Jehovah kole, Matinyei chuto kiptaiyat; ingoweek chi tugul kwo gonnyi eng’ kalyet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji laitoriatab Israel Jeosapat, Kamamwaun ale, mamaoteni tuguk che miach agobo ane, kobate yaitiet? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kile Mikaia, Kas anyun ng’olyotab Jehovah; kiageer Jehovah kotebyei eng’ ng’echerennyi ne bo laitornatet, ak kitononi luget tugul ne bo kipsengwet eng’ eunnyi ne bo tai ak ne bo katam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kile Jehovah, Ng’o ne iberberi Ahab, si kwo kotogosta ak kome eng’ Ramot- gilead? Ak kimwa age ko u ni; komwa age ko u ni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kimong’ tamirmiriet age ak kotonon eng’ taitab Jehovah, ak kole, Aberberi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kimwachi Jehovah inendet kolenji, Iberbertoi ano? Ak kile, Awendi ak aegu tamirmiriet ne kenisiei eng’ kutuswekab maotikyik tugul. Ak kimwa inendet kole, Iberberi inendet, ak iterter: ui anyun, ak iyai ko u noto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ara anyun, keero, kainde Jehovah tamirmiriet ne kenisiei kutuswekab maotichuguk tugul; ak kagomwa Jehovah yaitiet agobo inye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korik anyun Sedekia weritab Kenaana, ak korabach Mikaia matanda, ak kolenji, Kabun ano tamirmirietab Jehovah ak konyo kong’alalun? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kile Mikaia, Keero, igeere eng’ betunoto, tun iwendi got ne bo orit iunyege. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kimwa laitoriatab Israel kole, Onam Mikaia, ak oweekte omutyi Amon bounindetab nganaset, ak Joas weritab laitoriat; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak kolenji, Kamwa laitoriat ko u ni, kole, Onde chichi korgoret, ak obae amitwogikab nyalilda, ak beekab nyalilda, agoi aweeige eng’ kalyet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kile Mikaia, Ngot iweeige iman eng’ kalyet, ko kaga ma ng’alalena Jehovah. Ak kile, Ogas okwek bik tugul.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitogosta anyun laitoriatab Israel ak Jeosapat laitoriatab Juda koba Ramot- gilead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kilenji laitoriatab Israel Jeosapat, Awalege aegu age, ak awe luget; ago ilaach inye ngoroiguk che bo laitornatet. Kowalgei anyun laitoriatab Israel koek age, ak kwo luget.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiga ng’at laitoriatab Suria kiptainik sosom ak aeng’ che bo karisiekyik, kolenji, Amat obarge ak ne ming’in anan ko ne o, kobate laitoriatab Israel inegei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingogeer kiptainichoto bo karisiek Jeosapat, kole, Iman, nito laitoriatab Israel; ak kiwelelgei kobargei ak inendet: ak kiwaach Jeosapat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingogeer kiptainikab karisiek kole ma laitoriatab Israel ni, koweek, mata kosub inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "King’i chito age kwangennyi kosapsapchi, ak kitiech laitoriatab Israel ole tuiyechin karikyik che kiilaachi: kolenji anyun chito ne kweriei karinnyi, Imuta amanda eng’ ole mi luget; amu kagiguotena mising’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kitesak luget betunoto: ak kigiti laitoriat eng’ karinnyi kotokyigei Suriek, ak kime koskoleny: ak kiitenden korotik eng’ ng’otobet koba kobun kelutab karit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kibiit waagat eng’ luget komugul komachei kororokto asista, kele, Ingwo chi tugul nganasennyi, ak kwo chi tugul emennyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kome anyun laitoriat, ak kigisut konyo Samaria; ak kitub ichek laitoriat eng’ Samaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiun bik karit eng’ tamboiyotab Samaria; ak kimel sesenik korotikyik; (kiunegei yoto chepkugonik;) ko u ng’olyotab Jehovah ne kimwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak boisionik che ng’etunotin che bo Ahab ak tuguk tugul che kiyai, ak gotab kelekab belek ne kiteech, ak nganasok tugul che kiteech, ko tos ma sirotin eng’ bukuitab ateptab betusiek ne bo laitorinikab Israel? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koru anyun Ahab ak kwanisiekyik; ak kilaitoran Aasia werinnyi kogeer inendet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jeosapat, laitoriatab Juda, ak Aasia, laitoriatab Israel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kitoi kolaitoran Jeosapat weritab Asa eng’ Juda eng’ kenyitab ang’wan ne bo Ahab laitoriatab Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki bo Jeosapat kenyisiek sosom ak mut ye kitau kolaitorani; ak kilaitoran kenyisiek tiptem ak mut eng’ Jerusalem. Ak kigiguure kamennyi Asuba cheptab Sili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiwendote ortinwek tugul che bo Asa kwandanyi; ma masta eng’ ortinwechato, kiyai ne mie eng’ taitab Jehovah: agos kima kiisto komoswek che tororen; kita koenyei bik tiseiywek, ak kobeelei nyamdutik eng’ komoswechato tororen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiyai kalyet Jeosapat ak laitoriatab Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak boisionik che ng’etunotin che bo Jeosapat, ak kimnatennyi ne kiibor, ak ole kiyaita lugosiek, ko tos ma sirotin eng’ bukuitab ateptab betusiek ne bo laitorinikab Juda?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiisto eng’ emet sodomik che kiga ng’et eng’ betusiekab kwandanyi Asa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kima komi laitorianda Edom: ki laitoriat chito ne kirubei laitoriat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiyai Jeosapat melisiekab Taris si koba Opir koib tahabu: ago ma ba; amu kibutok melisiechoto eng’ Esion-geber.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.48"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolenji anyun Aasia weritab Ahab Jeosapat, Chamji otwogikyuk koba ak otwogiguk eng’ melisiek. Ago ma cham Jeosapat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiru Jeosapat ak kwanisiekyik, ak kigitupchi ole kigitupchi kwanisiekyik eng’ nganasetab Daudi kwandanyi: ak kilaitoran Jeoram werinnyi kogeer inendet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.50"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitoi kolaitoran Aasia weritab Ahab eng’ Israel eng’ Samaria, eng’ kenyitab taman ak tisab ne bo Jeosapat laitoriatab Juda, ak kilaitoran kenyisiek aeng’ eng’ Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.51"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiyai yaitiet eng’ taitab Jehovah, ak kowendote ortinwekab kwandanyi, ak ortinwekab kamennyi ak ortinwekab Jeroboam weritab Nebat, ne kiibeete Israel si koyai tengekto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.22.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.22.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 22:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiot Baal, ak kogutung’ji, ak kotach Jehovah, Kamuktaindetab Israel, konerech, ko u tuguk tugul che kiga yai kwandanyi.",
          "type": "text",
